    "descriptionZh": "一个 API 把 Stellar 各家钱包一次性接上，README 明说这个库只管连接和签名、UI/UX 归调用方自己决定。文档在 stellarwalletskit.dev，覆盖 albedo、freighter、xbull 等钱包。",
    "takeawayZh": "一次接入 albedo/freighter/xbull 等钱包",
    "noteZh": "README 首句是 A kit to handle all Stellar Wallets at once with a simple API and without caring about individual configurations for each one of them，紧接一句说明它只管连接与交互、UI/UX 交给开发者。Getting started 给了完整调用：npx jsr add 装包，StellarWalletsKit.init({modules: defaultModules()}) 初始化，createButton 出一个认证按钮，再 getAddress 和 signTransaction。About 栏列了 albedo、freighter、soroban、stellar、wallets、xbull 六个 topic，MIT 许可、Used by 320。",
